BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Ekadashi (Krishna) — Ashvina / एकादशी (कृष्
 ण) — आश्विन
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261105
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261106
DTSTAMP:20261103T045158Z
UID:ekadashi-2026-11-05@dharmasetu
CATEGORIES:ekadashi
DESCRIPTION:Why: twice a lunar month\, step back from heavy food and hurry
  — make space for attention.\n\nStory: Ekadashi is the 11th tithi of eac
 h fortnight — a Vaishnava fasting day for restraint\, prayer and digesti
 on-rest.\nSource: Padma Purana ekadashi mahatmya\; Smriti\nWhy: twice a lu
 nar month\, step back from heavy food and hurry — make space for attenti
 on.\nModern angle: Intermittent fasting shows metabolic and microbiome lin
 ks in peer-reviewed work\; ekadashi as a named practice is cultural.\nEvid
 ence: Plausible\nLink: https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10894978/
 \nMore: https://saumya-sharma.github.io/dharmasetu/prototype/reasoning.htm
 l#ekadashi-fasting\nLocation basis: New Delhi. City-specific timing coming
  later.
LOCATION:New Delhi\, India (reference)
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://saumya-sharma.github.io/dharmasetu/prototype/calendar.html#ca3
 253e5e4c50755
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Diwali / Deepavali / दीपावली
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261108
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261109
DTSTAMP:20261103T045158Z
UID:diwali-2026-11-09@dharmasetu
CATEGORIES:festivals
DESCRIPTION:Why: light the home when the moon is dark — invite prosperit
 y\, kinship and clarity after the ancestral fortnight.\n\nStory: Diwali (D
 eepavali) on the amavasya of Ashvina (amanta) / Kartika lights lamps for R
 ama's return and Lakshmi's grace in the darkest new-moon night.\nSource: R
 amayana return narrative\; Padma Purana Lakshmi strands\nWhy: light the ho
 me when the moon is dark — invite prosperity\, kinship and clarity after
  the ancestral fortnight.\nModern angle: Light\, gathering and gift ritual
 s support mood and social ties in dark season\; cultural/psychological wit
 h seasonal-affect context.\nEvidence: Cultural/psychological\nMore: https:
 //saumya-sharma.github.io/dharmasetu/prototype/reasoning.html#calendar-lun
 isolar\nLocation basis: New Delhi. City-specific timing coming later.
LOCATION:New Delhi\, India (reference)
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://saumya-sharma.github.io/dharmasetu/prototype/calendar.html#11c
 9bda8c6d35afe
END:VEVENT
