 ured for satyanarayan katha\, charity and calm observance.\nSource: Pancha
 nga tradition\; Smriti calendrical practice\nWhy: the brightest night invi
 tes collective prayer and completion rites.\nModern angle: Full moon is an
  astronomical fact\; claimed behavioural effects remain mixed in research 
 — labelled cultural here.\nEvidence: Cultural/psychological\nMore: https
 ://saumya-sharma.github.io/dharmasetu/prototype/reasoning.html#calendar-lu
 nisolar\nLocation basis: New Delhi. City-specific timing coming later.
