CATEGORIES:festivals\,birth-auspicious
DESCRIPTION:Why: mark the turn toward longer light and dedicate the season
  of growth to speech\, learning and the arts.\n\nStory: Vasant Panchami ho
 nours Saraswati on Magha Shukla Panchami\, when spring (vasanta) begins to
  show and learning\, music and yellow mustard fields are celebrated.\nSour
 ce: Puranic Saraswati lore\; regional Grihya customs\nWhy: mark the turn t
 oward longer light and dedicate the season of growth to speech\, learning 
 and the arts.\nModern angle: Seasonal / cultural marker. No clinical outco
 me claim\; supports community learning rituals.\nEvidence: Cultural/psycho
 logical\nMore: https://saumya-sharma.github.io/dharmasetu/prototype/reason
 ing.html#calendar-lunisolar\nLocation basis: New Delhi. City-specific timi
